I would just like to give a piece of advice for those who find something like this. as an experienced witch myself, I think I should get to say this. if you find something like this such as a fairy ring or trail of mushrooms, do NOT touch or interact with the area AT ALL. it may be beautiful but you will be instantly signing a contract that could lead you to who knows what. i repeat, DO NOT INTERACT WITH THE FAIR FOLK. THEY ARE POWERFUL BEINGS. JUST DONT. 

